      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "H3 Portrait 1.5\n1. Upload subject images and any pose/camera guide. Choose per-image roles in the uploader.\n2. For your three-photo case: Image 1 Face only; Image 2 Body/proportions only; Image 3 Pose/camera only.\n3. Keep Role-aware (recommended). Guide pixels do not go to H3; their geometry is translated to text.\n4. Start Draft only. The preview shows the exact routing and final prompt.\n5. Select only compatible H3 LoRAs, then choose Generate video.\n6. Export saves MP4 plus a matching _last.png from the actual encoded video.\nStandard/full = 20 steps; Standard/HQ = 16 at a smaller canvas. No turbo is enabled.\nNative manual workflow is separate and bypasses Ollama.\nReplace the example video brief with your own request."
      ]
